=== what to report ===
Heaps' exponent falls from 0.0675 on gene calls to 0.0291 on
sequence. Current practice places the open/closed boundary near 0.3, so
both are closed, but the sequence-based estimate is the defensible one
and it is the more closed of the two.

The strict core rises because annotation dropout was scoring present
genes as absent. That is the positive form of the pan-GWAS negative
result: the same correction that destroys the associations improves the
pan-genome description.

